{
  "_comment": [
    "Hardware profiles for FLUX.1 Schnell in ComfyUI.",
    "00-check-hardware.sh picks a profile; 03-download-models.sh fetches its files;",
    "apply-profile.py rewrites workflows/*.json to reference them.",
    "",
    "'verified: true' means the URL was taken verbatim from a model manifest shipped",
    "inside ComfyUI 0.30.0 (blueprints/*.json) and is therefore ComfyUI-official.",
    "'verified: false' means the URL follows the documented upstream layout but was NOT",
    "reachable for confirmation from the authoring environment - 03-download-models.sh",
    "HEAD-checks every URL and refuses to start downloading if any of them 404."
  ],

  "license_note": "FLUX.1 Schnell is Apache-2.0: commercial use of the model and its outputs is permitted. FLUX.1 dev is NOT (non-commercial licence) and is deliberately excluded from this pack.",

